OL,5,G0100 Behind Bars: World's Toughest
OL,6,G     Prisons
OL,7,     FTaichung Men's Prison is the
OL,8,     Ftoughest in Taiwan, housing some
OL,9,     Fof the country's most dangerous
OL,10,     Fcriminals and operating a system
OL,11,     Fof "progressive correctional
OL,12,     Ftreatment".
OL,13,G0205 Behind Bars: World's Toughest
OL,14,G     Prisons
OL,15,     FThe high-security facility on the
OL,16,     Foutskirts of Bucharest houses the
OL,17,     Fmost dangerous criminals,
OL,18,     Fincluding murderers, rapists and
OL,19,     Fhuman traffickers. Escape is near
OL,20,     Fimpossible. (Ep4)
